      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Today I tested both, the lay/sit prefab by Nirvash and the GoGo Loco system. The lay/sit prefab works as expected in live and IK beta, but I couldn't get GoGo Loco to work, it was just a big mess. \nCould be user error, could be a bug in GoGo Loco or a bug in the current VRChat version. However, at the moment the Nirvash lay/sit prefab is the way to go.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
